  "qualifications": [
    "Candidate art repeats front/rear paint, stretches insets at grazing angles and places the painted tier bands low in overhead views. Shallow geometric carving and baked highlights need author review. The accepted 2D reference is not acceptance of this native conversion.",
    "Fifteen detail/underside views, the floor overview and both presentation scenes were inspected. Visual03 uses final mesh bytes over #751; continuity/presentation use the complete installed package.",
    "One sequential700-tic nine-object pair measures queue intervals only, not GPU/display timing, repeatability, campaign or crowd performance; projected footprints differ.",
    "Native pickup/equip/unequip/toss APIs and prepared Box/quest state do not prove ordinary menus, casting/crafting or author acceptance. Water is a valid existing test essence; quintessence remains invalid for offensive Orbs.",
    "Broader inventory, characters, modular equipment and V5.16 campaign remain unfinished. No executable, IWAD, PK3/WAD, DLL or save committed.",
    "The final presentation runner also enforces the observed nine-body/700-sample completion count. Its new postprocessing block was replayed against both unchanged presentation01 logs, rather than repeating an otherwise unchanged native benchmark."
  ],
